# [RXTDUP] rxtnul lane fixture: TWO 'description' LINES IN ONE PATTERN
# BLOCK. Before this fix the second silently WON — `block->description`
# is a single field, unconditionally overwritten, exit 0, no diagnostic
# (M5, docs/design/dd13_format/bench_rxt_needs_v1.md §1.9). Now it
# refuses BY NAME, naming both lines — the same discipline as
# dup_block_name.rxtin's duplicate-name refusal, one field over. Headless
# (the population every corpus file is in, that fixture's own reason).
pattern a+
name one
description the first one
description the second one
m "aaa" 0 3
